# GitHub requires a signed-in session for these social pages, so they answer
# 404 to the link checker while working fine in a browser. Verified against
# an unrelated repository (torvalds/linux/stargazers) to rule out a problem
# with this one.
https://github.com/.*/stargazers
https://github.com/.*/watchers

# The Store listing answers 410 until the app passes certification and is
# published. The product ID is already assigned and the link is the one
# users will follow, so it stays in the README rather than being removed
# and added back.
https://apps\.microsoft\.com/detail/9NC63J47B5C5

# Partner Center serves a certificate chain the checker does not trust,
# while browsers accept it. The link is a reference for the maintainer, not
# something a reader follows.
https://partner\.microsoft\.com/dashboard
